---
title: "Sequence: creating a BEDROCK destination"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Destination stack
  box Service account
    participant A as Framework API
    participant W as Destination workflow
  end
  box Tenant account
    participant R as Destination role
    participant S as Destination bucket
    participant KB as Bedrock knowledge base
    participant L as Ingestion log group
  end
  D->>R: Create the destination role and its boundaries
  D->>A: CreateDestination
  A->>W: Save the destination CREATING_BUCKET, start the workflow
  W->>R: Assume the role with the workflow's ARN as the external ID
  W->>S: Create the bucket: block public access, SSE-S3, TLS-only policy
  W->>KB: Create the knowledge base role, the knowledge base, and its data source
  W->>L: Deliver the knowledge base's ingestion logs
  W->>A: Record ACTIVE with the resource IDs
  loop Until ACTIVE or FAILED
    D->>A: GetDestination
  end
  opt The configuration declares metadata fields
    D->>A: UpdateDestination
    A->>KB: Set the fields through the destination role
  end
